summary: Define how tests should be executed

description: |
    Run discovered tests in the provisioned environment. The internal
    ``tmt`` executor is used by default. It reports test progress and
    supports optional interactive debugging.

    This is a **required** attribute. Each plan has to define this
    step. See the :ref:`/plugins/execute` documentation for available
    methods and supported options.

example: |
    execute:
        how: tmt

link:
    - implemented-by: /tmt/steps/execute
